  "goodToKnow": "Die Grube is a pit, whether dug in the ground (eine Baugrube, a building pit) or a mine (die Kohlengrube). Famous proverb: Wer andern eine Grube gräbt, fällt selbst hinein (who digs a pit for others falls into it himself). Idiom: in die Grube fahren, an old and rather blunt way of saying to die. The related verb is graben (to dig)."
